{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43006","headline":"水殿抛球曲二首 二 · 李谨言","name":"水殿抛球曲二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堪恨隋家几帝王，舞裀揉尽绣鸳鸯。\n如今重到抛球处，不是金鑪旧日香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李谨言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《诗人玉屑》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩人玉屑_(四庫全書本)）"}